      "settings": {
        "badge_text": "Federally Approved | ADR-Tested | SSM Certified",
        "heading_line_1": "Chevrolet Silverado 1500",
        "heading_line_2": "NB1 SSM Lift Packages",
        "band_heading": "Go Big. Stay Legal: Federally Approved Lift Packages for Your Silverado 1500 Pre rego ONLY",
        "band_background": "#000000",
        "band_text_color": "#56bdc2",
        "body": "<p>You didn’t buy a Chevy Silverado 1500 to blend in. But if you want to run massive tyres, lift it to the sky, and actually <em>use</em> it for serious towing and payload—all while staying completely legal on Australian roads—factory suspension just won't cut it.</p><p>Enter our <strong>Federally Approved Second Stage Manufacture (SSM) Packages</strong>.</p><p>Engineered exclusively for the Australian market, these comprehensive upgrades combine premium <strong>BDS Suspension</strong> lifts with race-proven <strong>Fox Shocks</strong>. Whether you are looking for an aggressive daily driver or a towering off-road monster on 37s, we have a pre-registration package to match your vision.</p><p>Say goodbye to the factory 757 KG payload limit. Every stage below includes a fully certified GVM upgrade, bumping your payload.</p><p>Choose your stance.</p><p>Contact an Authorised ORI GVM Installer.</p>",
        "disclaimer": "<p>*Please note that some workshops may apply additional discretionary administration fees to the quoted installation and engineering price. Shipping is not included in the price.</p>",
        "padding_top": 80,
        "padding_bottom": 64
      }
    },
